The combined menu bar icon (battery arc, network glyph, volume dots), its settings and its
charging animation are modeled on Status Trio by lingyired
(https://github.com/lingyired/status-trio), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
The icon's layout coordinates (120-unit canvas, ring center, radius, sweep and the volume
dot positions) are taken from Status Trio's status-menubar.svg. BalDente's drawing and
animation code is its own.
